# Epic — Lesson Experience

> **For epic-executor:** This epic will be executed wave-by-wave.
> **Required pre-reading by every wave's build subagent:**
> 1. Charter: `automatiklabs/docs/educational-system/CHARTER.md`
> 2. Context: `docs/educational-system/context/lesson-experience.md`
> 3. Skill: `automatiklabs-doctrine`

## Goal

Build the lesson page UI that delivers a personalized, CBE-first learning experience for every learner profile in the Cubo 3D — replacing time-based progress signals with competency-based signals, rendering persona-adapted layouts via PersonaWrapper, and providing honest feedback on unlock state and evidence submission.

## Scope

- Components under `automatiklabs/src/app/(platform)/learn/**` and `automatiklabs/src/shared/components/lesson/**`.
- Consumes `resolve_lesson_for_user` RPC and the 4 secondary RPCs defined in `schema-extensions.md`.
- Delivers `<PersonaWrapper>`, `<LessonPlayer>`, `<ChapterNav>`, `<EvidenceSubmitter>`, `<CompetencyGraph>`, `<UnlockReasonModal>`, `<NextActionCard>`, `<FallbackNotice>`.
- Does NOT write to `lesson_variants.content_overrides`, does NOT own schema, does NOT define assessment grading logic.

## Stories

### Story 1: Implement PersonaWrapper server component
- **id:** LESSX-01
- **points:** M
- **deps:** []
- **acceptance_criteria:**
  - [ ] `src/shared/components/lesson/persona-wrapper.tsx` exists as a Next.js server component.
  - [ ] Accepts `LayoutOverrides` prop (§4.2 shape in context doc).
  - [ ] Applies all 9 differentiation axes (scaffolding_level, visible_sections, show_checkpoints, etc.).
  - [ ] No `if (persona === '...')` conditionals inside the component — uses `layout_overrides` as reducer input.
  - [ ] `deriveDefaultOverrides()` in `src/shared/lib/persona/derive-overrides.ts` exists and produces valid defaults for all 3 personas.
  - [ ] Component verified against `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` (non-stock Next.js — confirm API compatibility).
  - **screens:** lesson page
  - **accessibility_notes:** Scaffold level 3 (Zerado) must not reduce ARIA landmark coverage.

### Story 2: Implement FallbackNotice component + honest fallback display
- **id:** LESSX-02
- **points:** S
- **deps:** [LESSX-01]
