## Notes for the future executor agent

- This is a non-stock Next.js distribution. Before creating any new route, layout, or server component, read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` to verify the API. Do not assume stock Next.js behavior.
- All copy strings must go through `src/shared/lib/tone/tokens.ts`. Never hardcode PT-BR strings in JSX.
- Only ONE RPC call per lesson page render: `resolve_lesson_for_user`. If data is missing, add a field to the RPC — do not add a second fetch.
- Never write to `lesson_variants.content_overrides`. RLS will reject it. This column belongs to Content Production.
- Every component must ship with a 375px layout. This is a ship gate, not a nice-to-have.
- `data-testid` attributes on each Kolb section (Contexto, Conceito, Demonstração, Prática, Síntese) are required for Pedagogical QA's E2E tests.
